    "rich_text_BBr47R": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dpmmMR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Should You Work With an Industry Leader in NADCO?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_aHMH7i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At NADCO, we firmly believe that rugged and high-visibility safety tapes and labels are essential to any work environment. We carry an expansive selection of standard safety tape and labels to improve employee awareness and promote a safe workplace in various work environments. We can also design <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/labels\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/labels\">custom labels</a> and tapes for specialized applications.</p><p>We efficiently manufacture high-quality tapes and labels, including glow-in-the-dark tape, barricades, and anti-slip tape. Our selection of indoor and outdoor products offers versatility to serve residential, municipal, industrial, commercial, and retail applications. As an industry leader, NADCO delivers US-made products at competitive prices with quick lead times. Our team can also design custom solutions for specialized or complex applications.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
