    "rich_text_PnPP8T": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_fXUjHz": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "OSHA Compliant Tapes and Labels From NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_e3BrBD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Complying with OSHA is essential to maintaining a safe, healthy, and productive workplace. Labels and tapes made from durable and high visibility materials help workers stay safe and help employers maintain OSHA compliance. NADCO delivers safety tapes and labels made from rugged materials with eye-catching designs to meet or exceed OSHA standards. <a href=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">Contact us</a> to learn how our products can improve workplace safety for your facility or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> today.</p>",
